    "created_at": "2026-03-20T09:16:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-20T09:16:44Z",
    "body": "I don't think anything allows for a race here? They're all synchronous algorithms until you're somewhere deep in navigate. The one thing that might be good to test is that you can change these attributes from the `submit` event and the changes should be accounted for.\n\nAnd I guess I'm not really sure what the proposal is here because `requestSubmit()` already supports the overrides as long as you supply a submit button.",
