    "created_at": "2026-03-20T13:41:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-20T13:41:41Z",
    "body": "The proposal is to allow you to specify the overrides without a submit button in the DOM. I think this is useful in any scenario where you might want to call requestSubmit without a button (which is a scenario that is already supported today), but you also want to apply overrides.",
